message: >-
  If this research archive or its proposed DECA formulation contributes to
  your work, please cite this repository and the ISCAS 2025 ECA paper.
type: software
title: "Discriminative Energy Component Analysis: Research Archive and Roadmap"
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Rongzhou
    alias: Lachlan Chen
repository-code: "https://github.com/lachlanchen/discriminative-energy-component-analysis"
url: "https://github.com/lachlanchen/discriminative-energy-component-analysis"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-27
abstract: >-
  A research compendium for Eigen-Component Analysis, including its historical
  sources, a mathematical and implementation audit, and a proposed
  class-conditional energy-contrast formulation based on shared-eigenbasis
  quadratic operators and supervised joint diagonalization.
keywords:
  - eigen-component analysis
  - discriminative feature extraction
  - quadratic classification
  - joint diagonalization
  - class-conditional second moments
  - commuting operators
  - quantum-inspired machine learning
  - subspace learning
